Meson recipe. Requires gobject-introspection tooling (g-ir-scanner,
g-ir-compiler, gobject-introspection-1.0.pc) and GLib >= 2.56 -- the ISO
ships GObject-Introspection and GLib 2.63.5, so no extra recipes are needed.
-Dpycairo=true needs PyCairo installed for python3.11; -Dtests=false skips
the test build. The generated PyGObject-3.44.1-py3.11.egg-info makes Lutris'
install_requires check succeed without touching PyPI.
Build AFTER Python 3.11.12 + PyCairo.
